&lt;li&gt;Rigorously and continuously evaluate the progress of products and features in flight by leveraging test cases and ensuring compliance with product specifications and the overall vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with both internal stakeholders and external users at client organizations to gather feedback, identify pain points, and prioritize impactful product improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and analyze product usage data and user feedback to guide roadmap priorities and inform investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market research and competitive landscape analysis to stay ahead of industry trends in treasury and post-trade technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate business cases, estimate timelines and budgets, and communicate with all stakeholders; prepare project plans, release notes, and other artifacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product managers across other product groups on cross-cutting programs and initiatives to provide comprehensive business solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of overall work experience, with a minimum of 2 years in product management preferably for financial technology products or platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using AI coding assistants and vibe-coding / rapid-prototyping approaches to build working product prototypes. You should be comfortable going from idea to interactive demo without waiting for engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer empathy and a deep understanding of client needs, preferably with experience working directly with hedge funds or institutional asset managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at balancing technical requirements with user and stakeholder needs, both internally and at enterprise client organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with engineering teams in an agile software development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding academic background and a passion to work in a high-tech software development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinking and the ability to articulate standpoints and ideas and influence stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multitask and manage multiple lines of execution with attention to detail and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high level of personal maturity and a collaborative attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A healthy combination of resourcefulness, domain expertise, creativity, and execution prowess.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain expertise in treasury and post-trade processes such as collateral management, margin calculation, portfolio financing, securities borrow/lend, or related middle- and back-office functions, is optional but nice to have.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
